# This file is informational only — nothing in this app reads .env or
# environment variables for configuration. It's documentation of what to
# register, not a config path.
#
# To register a Twitch application at https://dev.twitch.tv/console ->
# Register Your Application:
#   - Application type: "Public" (no client secret — this app uses the
#     Device Code OAuth flow, which never needs one).
#   - OAuth Redirect URL: http://localhost (unused by Device Code Flow, but
#     Twitch requires a value here to save the app).
#
# Paste the resulting Client ID into the running app's Ajustes window
# (Cuenta de Twitch -> Client ID -> Guardar). That is the only place it's
# actually read from.
